# Always deploy OpenFilament

When finishing implementation work for this repo:

1. Commit when the user asked to ship/deploy, or when they established standing instruction to deploy (treat “altijd direct deploy” as standing).
2. Push `main` to `origin`.
3. Deploy to production VPS without waiting for a second confirmation:
   - `rsync` to `root@212.227.245.191:/srv/open-filament/` (exclude `node_modules`, `.next`, sqlite, `.env`, `.git`, bridge `target`)
   - On the server: install (stdin closed for pnpm), build packages + api + web, migrate DB if needed, restart `openfilament-api` and `openfilament-web`
   - Smoke-check `https://openfilament.nl` (and key new routes)
4. Never commit secrets (`.env`, Stripe `sk_*`, session secrets).
5. Keep production `/etc/open-filament/env` updated for new non-secret public env vars; secrets only via server env.
